<p>10/01/2016		2,105M    5.70  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 10/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 10/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, October 17, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on October 31, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>First Albany Corporation</p>
